2. SUCCESS RATE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Algorithm    Random    Canyon    Clustered    Maze
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
  A*           100%      100%      100%         100%
  RRT*          59.5%     73.2%     99.2%         0%

  Key finding: A* achieves 100% success in all environments.
  RRT* completely fails in maze environments (0%) due to its
  straight-line steering being unable to thread 1-voxel-wide
  corridors. RRT* performs best in clustered environments (99.2%).


