5. TRADE-OFFS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  A* strengths:
  - 100% success rate across all environments
  - 10–44× faster planning time
  - Handles maze environments (RRT* cannot)
  - Deterministic and predictable

  RRT* strengths:
  - Around 5–7% shorter paths where it succeeds
  - 20–80× smoother paths (fewer direction changes)
  - Better  for real-time trajectory where there is a requirement on smoothness

  Recommendation:
    For reliability and speed → A*
    For path quality in open/clustered environments → RRT*
    For maze/tight-corridor environments → A* only

